; mbfolder.def - module definition for the MbFolder WPS class DLL.
;
; Same export set as the original SOM 1.0 emitdef output (orig\MBFOLDER.DEF),
; plus SOMInitModule: modern SOM class libraries export an SOMInitModule
; entry point that creates the class object(s) via <class>NewClass when the
; DLL is loaded (the sc-generated mbfolder.c template in gen\ contains it).
;
; The sc 'def' emitter is deliberately NOT used so this file stays under
; our control (Watcom wlink does not consume IBM .def directly - the
; Makefile carries the equivalent EXPORT clauses).

LIBRARY MBFOLDER INITINSTANCE
DESCRIPTION 'MbFolder Class Library - Watcom port of the 1993 IBM Japan sample'
PROTMODE
DATA MULTIPLE NONSHARED LOADONCALL
EXPORTS
    MbFolderClassData
    MbFolderCClassData
    MbFolderNewClass
    M_MbFolderClassData
    M_MbFolderCClassData
    M_MbFolderNewClass
    SOMInitModule
